      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠪᠣᠰᠬᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>bosqaqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>босгох</cyrillic>
      <transcript>BOSXA-</transcript>
      <definition>[v. cans. of boS-] To cause or orderto arise; to raise, construct, erect; to establish, to help to flee or desert.</definition>
      <page>122</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠣᠰᠬᠠᠵᠤ ᠪᠠᠷᠢᠬᠤ</unicode>
